+A hedge (backup request) is a duplicate leaf call issued while the original is still pending,
+often after a latency trigger. For first-acceptable semantics, only an eligible success should
+win; an early error or stale answer can be ignored only while eligible alternatives remain
+available. Hedging trades extra work for possible tail improvement; it does not fix a saturated
+dependency.
 
